ed-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……但是，果然还是防备着我呢」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-687","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-687"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"防备？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6a7","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6a7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"果然，这家伙……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-6e9","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-6e9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「勇太，难道说你对加奈……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-723","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-723"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-751","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-751"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是这样吗？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-778","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-778"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……与其这样说，还不如说我是藤堂同学的支持者」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-7c0","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-7c0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「支持者？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-o