9bc","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9bc"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"为我自己都不明白的理由。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9e6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9e6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"难道说这是要被抢走女儿的父亲的心态么？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a15","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a15"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"还是说是担心妹妹被抢走的哥哥的心态更为贴切？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a63","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a63"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「藤堂同学……仍然是洁白无暇的」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-aa3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-aa3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"勇太开始说道。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-b20","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-b20"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「就是说，还没有被这个世界上的污垢所污染……","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-b62","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-b62"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"纯粹的，单纯的，而且胆小的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-b87","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-b87"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在学校的时候，身处于周边的未知世界的时候……她并没有融入进去，而是漂浮于其外。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-bd8","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-bd8"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就在那个时候。我和偶尔来学校的她说话了」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-c1b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-c1b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-c40","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-c40"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「但是最开始就被无视了。或者说，被害怕了……","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-c84","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-c84"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而这样我就更加较上真了，我想方设法地缠着她和她说话……渐渐地就被真正的讨厌了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-cdf","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-cdf"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"别看我这样，当时我可是真的很失落哦」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-d2a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-d2a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"勇太挠着头露出了腼腆的微笑。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-d5b","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-d5b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在这之后，神色突然就又认真了起来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-ddf","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-ddf"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……然后我就此反省了。尽可能温柔地对待她。","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-e22","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-e22"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当她在学校里被卷入麻烦之中的时候，我就悄悄施以援手。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-e6a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-e6a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"由于我认识很多人，学校的那些不良团体中也有我以前的玩伴。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-eb3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-eb3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"啊、我可没有做过什么不良的勾当哦！","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-edd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-edd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"总之就是利用这层关系，造成了一种“不要对藤堂出手”的状况……」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-f26","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-f26"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-f66","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-f66"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「等注意到的时候，我的眼中就只有她了。就是这样」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-fb2","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-fb2"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「你还没有回答我呢。为什么会憧憬着加奈」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-ff0","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-ff0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「这个。这是我在做这些事情的过程中渐渐注意到的。加奈和别人不一样。并不是由于病弱而不能来学校这点的“不一样”，而在于内心」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-106f","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-106f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「内心？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-10b0","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-10b0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我觉得她的内心非常美丽。虽然有些胆怯，但是却没有憎恨过任何人。","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1108","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1108"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"现在的年轻人呢，无论是怎么样的一个人，都会有憎人恨人欺人之心。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1152","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1152"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这些可能是亲人，可能是兄弟，可能是朋友，可能是欺负自己的人，可能是比自己弱的人，也可能是整个世界……呢」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-11b1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-11b1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「嘛，说不定是这样呢」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-11e5","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-11e5"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我过去，也曾疏远过加奈。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1212","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1212"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我一想到这个胸口就一阵剧痛。一股名为罪恶感的剧痛。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1263","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1263"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「就算是我也会这样的。偶尔有女性朋友谈及『伊藤～这下糟了，我可能要怀孕了呢～』之类的话题的时候，我心里不不由得就会想“你这家伙真是个笨蛋，还有脸活着么”。","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-12f4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-12f4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然不能在本人面前说出来了呢。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1322","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1322"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我只有随便的说着“没事的没事的”，这样搪塞着她，直到她完全安心下来为止。最后，那家伙还是去堕胎了呢。真是自作自受啊。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1395","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1395"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在堕胎之后，又和男人混到一起了哦？难以置信吧？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-13d8","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-13d8"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「这……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-141a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-141a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「但是，藤堂同学不一样。由于没有怎么接触这个世界，所以并没有被这个社会的疟疾所感染呢。当我明白这个的时候，我真是相当的感动。因此，我想，不守护好这一切可不行……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-14da","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-14da"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"结结巴巴地说着这些的勇太的面庞，稍稍泛起了一些红潮。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1511","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1511"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大概是平时没有说过这么令人脸红的话的缘故吧。在学校里，他一定是个冷静得多的人。这家伙还真是个善于揣度人心的家伙啊。原来如此，在对现代的中学生腻味的这家伙的眼中，加奈想必是一道『好菜』吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-15e9","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-15e9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「守护……么」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1618","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1618"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这和我的动机不约而同。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1663","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1663"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「如果需要从此开始守护藤堂同学的人，他也会是从此以后永远守护着藤堂同学的人。我，有这个自信」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-16d6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-16d6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-16fb","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-16fb"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「藤堂哥哥，难道没有想要做的事情吗？」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-173c","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-173c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「谁知道，还没有考虑呢」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-176a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-176a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「这可不行啊。如果没有想要做的事情的话，人就只会追求眼前的快乐了啊」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-17df","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-17df"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我突然地，害怕起这家伙来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-180e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-180e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这家伙也……太精了点吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-183a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-183a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这完全不是１５岁的思维方式。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1865","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1865"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"既能洞察人心，又能准确的判断。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1894","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1894"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"如果他拿出真功夫的话，迟早有一天会出人头地的吧，因为我觉得他无论是什么样的团体都能融入其中。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-18ff","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-18ff"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……但是我也没有。特别想要做的事情。所以为了藤堂同学不管花费多少时间，我都完全没关系。无论多少全部交给我吧。不过，前辈能够做到这点吗？」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-198f","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-198f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-19d2","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-19d2"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我在一个瞬间，曾经想说好的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1a07","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1a07"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这对于加奈来说，是一件好事吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1a44","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1a44"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我的心愿，难道不是让加奈一个人能够独立吗？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1a7e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1a7e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"难道不是想让她坚强地活下去么？","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1ac5","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1ac5"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我希望能够看到加奈作为普通女孩子的一面。如果能够看到这些我就安心了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1b16","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1b16"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是，内心深处却有种莫名的遗憾。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1b49","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1b49"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我说不定，是在讨厌我的加奈在这个世界中又多了一个接点这件事。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1b8e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1b8e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"所以我是在为如果将加奈这样托付给他，加奈就会被他夺走这点而踌躇吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1bd4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1bd4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……我和这家伙多多少少有些相似呢。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1c5d","targe