":"ikura-1db1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我该―――","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1e55/choice/arm-1e62","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1e55","choiceId":"arm-1e62"},"allowed":["choiceLabel"],"speakerReason":"structural-row","baseline":{"text":"【不行！】","speaker":"选项","choiceLabel":"不行！"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1e55/choice/arm-23f1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1e55","choiceId":"arm-23f1"},"allowed":["choiceLabel"],"speakerReason":"structural-row","baseline":{"text":"【哎呀，并不是那回事。支持他吧。】","speaker":"选项","choiceLabel":"哎呀，并不是那回事。支持他吧。"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1ec6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1ec6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1ef4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1ef4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「因为没有受到世间的污染，所以想要守护什么的？　原来是骗人的啊」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1f39","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1f39"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「但是！」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1f66","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1f66"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「如果真的是为加奈着想的话，首先应该希望加奈能够一个人坚强地活下去吧。守护一生？　以自己的牺牲为代价？　那么如果你这家伙在途中死了的话，加奈怎么办？」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1ff4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1ff4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2022","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2022"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「总之，你这家伙就是看加奈仍然是无垢的，就想让她染上你的色彩，难道不是这样么？　就像紫式部那样」（紫式部：藤原为时之女，和藤原宣孝结婚后其夫无子而亡）","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-20a3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-20a3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「不是这样的。我没有想过给她染上自己的颜色。因为我很珍惜藤堂同学的那份纯粹……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-210e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-210e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「所以正因为如此，我才说不行。正因为加奈是纯真的，什么也不知道的，弱小的。但是她要在这个世界上生存，不可能一辈子都凭借着这份弱小地生活下去吧。所以她不变得更加坚强的话是不行的」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-219d","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-219d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-21ce","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-21ce"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「如果你真的是喜欢加奈的话，首先要引导她靠自己来走属于自己的人生。但是啊」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2255","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2255"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我继续说道。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2280","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2280"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「那个时候的加奈，多半已经变成你讨厌的普通女孩子了吧」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-22c4","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-22c4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-22f7","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-22f7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"勇太自此以后陷入了沉默。他脸上的表情，已经不是往常那副微笑着的阳光少年的假面具了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2356","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2356"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，他转过身离开了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-23b7","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-23b7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……我，不想放弃」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2451","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2451"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「真的？　可以？」","speaker":"勇太"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2488","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev36/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2488"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text